.SH "نام (NAME)"
swappo \- swap msgid and msgstr fields in a PO file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBswappo\fR\ 'u
\fBswappo\fR [\fB\fIfilename\&.po\fR\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBswappo\fR
reads the given PO\-file and swaps the msgid and msgstr fields for every message\&. The result is a new PO\-file that translates in the opposite direction\&. For example, if PO\-file translates from English to French, the new PO\-file will translate from French to English\&.
.PP
The new PO\-file will be written to standard output\&. The old PO\-file will remain untouched\&.
.PP
This utility is part of the
KDE
Software Development Kit
